{"id": "section-body-29458", "title": "Enteropathic Arthritis (Associated with IBD)", "chapterId": "chapter-twenty-six", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "RHEUMATOLOGICAL DISORDERS", "Inflammatory Arthritis", "Enteropathic Arthritis (Associated with IBD)"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-29458", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Enteropathic Arthritis (Associated with IBD)", "runs": [{"text": "Enteropathic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Arthritis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Associated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "IBD)"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29459", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Enteropathic arthritis is a seronegative spondyloarthritis associated with inflammatory bowel disease (IBD). It can involve both the axial skeleton (spine and sacroiliac joints) and the peripheral joints, and may also present with enthesitis or dactylitis.", "runs": [{"text": "Enteropathic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "arthritis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "seronegative"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "spondyloarthritis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "associated"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "inflammatory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bowel"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "disease"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(IBD)."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "It"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "can"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "involve"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "both the axial skeleton (spine and sacroiliac joints) and the peripheral joints, and may also present with enthesitis or dactylitis."}]}, {"id": "body-29461", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-29462", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Peripheral arthritis: Asymmetric, large joints, Type 1: <5 joints, flares with IBD, Type 2: >5 joints, not linked to IBD activity", "runs": [{"text": "Peripheral"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "arthritis:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Asymmetric,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "large joints,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Type 1:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "<5 joints,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "flares"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with IBD,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Type 2:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": ">5 joints,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "not"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "linked to IBD activity"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29463", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Axial arthritis: Sacroiliitis, spondylitis,", "runs": [{"text": "Axial"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "arthritis:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Sacroiliitis,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "spondylitis,"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29464", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Enthesitis (Achilles ' heel), Dactylitis (sausage digits),", "runs": [{"text": "Enthesitis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Achilles"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "'"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "heel),"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Dactylitis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(sausage"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "digits),"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29465", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Uveitis and Skin: erythema nodosum, pyoderma gangrenosum", "runs": [{"text": "Uveitis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Skin:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "erythema"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "nodosum,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pyoderma"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gangrenosum"}], "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "105"}}, {"id": "body-29466", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "IBD symptoms: Diarrhea, abdominal pain, bleeding, weight loss", "runs": [{"text": "IBD"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "symptoms:"}, {"text": " "}, {"tex